# The normalisation map: the fields on which the GTK target and the Rune target may differ
# without that being a divergence. One rule to a line, sorted by field:
#
#   <field> <exception code> <issue>
#
# A field is named as an observation names it, with [] for every element of a list:
# app.focused, app.panes[].selected, fs, settings.show_hidden. A rule covers the field and
# everything below it. The codes are the plan's exceptions: timing, a11y, rune, oracle,
# toolkit, deviation, platform. A pull request adds only its own rules, and every fuzz
# summary prints how many there are. Noise that two replays on one target show is not an
# exception: it goes in calibration.mask. See docs/testing.md, "Fuzzing".
